---
source: crates/nuten_parser/tests/parse.rs
input_file: crates/nuten_parser/test_data/ok/list/pipes_beside_file_redirection.nu
---
Root@0..13
  Pipeline@0..12
    PipelineElement@0..12
      List@0..12
        LBracket@0..1 "["
        Word@1..2 "a"
        Whitespace@2..3 " "
        OutGt@3..5 "o>"
        Whitespace@5..6 " "
        Word@6..7 "b"
        Whitespace@7..8 " "
        Pipe@8..9 "|"
        Whitespace@9..10 " "
        Word@10..11 "c"
        RBracket@11..12 "]"
  Newline@12..13 "\n"
